      "content": "are you sure though? the stiffness feels really different than the incisions, like it's deep inside and i can barely move without it hurting a ton. and the fever is making me feel pretty shaky. i thought the doctor said i should watch out for \"red flags\" but you're saying it's just inflammation? i really dont want to deal with the ER again if i can just manage it here.",
